# Space (live server): combat with a level 45 mob, from the user's recording of 2026-11-20 (.work/e2e/223904-record,
# 78-147 s, the first fight). /createmob 1993 (GM: the server's Renegade Progen Tribuni, level 45, three skills of its
# own) puts the mob 200 ahead and 300 to the side; E (control_keys.ini [Target Near Enemy]) targets it. The hotbar's
# slots 4 and 5 (the recording's Rally and Repair Equipment; on the store's rows Biocessation and Enrage Group: below),
# SKILL_ABILITY each (the recording dragged Hacking from the PDA's
# skill list to slot 3; a replayed drag found the list scrolled elsewhere, so the scenario uses the hotbar as is). F (Fire all weapons: ACTION) fights until the mob
# explodes (POINT_EFFECT) and its hulk appears (CREATE). N (Next Target, until its Loot verb) targets the hulk, the
# target window's loot button asks for it (SKILL_STRING_RQ, LOOT_HULK_PERMISSION), and the loot window's first row is
# taken until the hulk is empty (INVENTORY_MOVE each; OPEN_INTERFACE when the last item is gone). The loot is random:
# how many items, and so how many takes, differs from run to run. Elanor's rows are
# those --db-snapshot 7 saves and puts back.
# Run: e2e.py --live --retail --db-snapshot 7 --instance space run sp_combat (it changes Elanor's cargo and hull).
name: space combat: spawn a level 45 mob, two hotbar skills, fire all, loot the hulk
timeout: 420
include _login_space
# the GM command in the chat entry; the server answers 'Creating Renegade Progen Tribuni at level 45' and creates it
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/createmob 1993'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'received CLIENT_CHAT$' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent CREATE$' within 15
wait-event antprox 'sent RELATIONSHIP$' within 15
shot mob_created
# E again until the client asks: right after the CREATE it may not yet know the mob (run 231808 sent nothing)
key 0x45 until antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET$' every 1.5 within 20
wait-event antprox 'sent SET_TARGET$' within 10
shot mob_targeted
# the hotbar as the store's rows (inputs/db/avatar7.sql, 2026-11-24) have it, clicked as the recording clicked its
# slot: 1-3 three weapons, slot 4 Biocessation (organic targets only), slot 5 Enrage Group, 6 another skill. The
# recording's slot 4 Rally and slot 5 Repair Equipment (2026-11-20's rows) are no longer there: waiting for an
# OBJECT_EFFECT after slot 4 failed on retail every time (2026-11-25: the server answers the Progen target with a
# PRIORITY_MESSAGE, the client's message line, and no effect; sp_warp's slot 5 is answered so too). Each click is
# repeated until the client sends SKILL_ABILITY (store .staging run 005451: one click 0.2 s after SET_TARGET sent
# nothing), then the server's answer, an effect or the message, is waited for
click 790,960 until antprox 'received SKILL_ABILITY$' every 2 within 12
wait-event antprox 'sent (OBJECT_EFFECT|PRIORITY_MESSAGE)$' within 15
# the shot 1 s after the answer (2026-11-25 CS: shot at once, ours drew the PRIORITY_MESSAGE's text a frame later)
wait-since antprox 'sent (OBJECT_EFFECT|PRIORITY_MESSAGE)$' 1
shot skill_slot4
click 865,960 until antprox 'received SKILL_ABILITY$' every 2 within 12
wait-event antprox 'sent (OBJECT_EFFECT|PRIORITY_MESSAGE)$' within 15
wait-since antprox 'sent (OBJECT_EFFECT|PRIORITY_MESSAGE)$' 1
shot skill_slot5
# the effects (brief CS2, c4): Rally and Repair Equipment from the PDA, as the recording dragged Hacking. The PDA
# (the second button at the lower left), its Skills page, the list's down arrow until its end (30 clicks; Elanor's
# 19 skills end Reactor Tech, Repair Equipment, Shield Tech, Terran Culture), then its up arrow once: Rally on top
# (its first ability, rank 1, at 50,632), Repair Equipment third (its first at 50,785) (CS2 probe 2026-11-25: the
# list keeps no fixed start, but its end is fixed). A click on an ability there uses nothing (the probe: no
# SKILL_ABILITY); a drag onto the hotbar's slots 4 and 5 puts them there (the instance's shortcut.ini, a fresh copy
# each run). The server answers both with an OBJECT_EFFECT on our ship (Net-7 ARally: the buff's effect 333;
# ARepairEquipment: 170, a mob target defaults to self)
click 96,918
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 71,258
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 20
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,805
click 322,593
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot pda_skills
down 50,632
up 790,960
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
down 50,785
up 865,960
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot pda_dragged
click 322,258
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
click 790,960 until antprox 'received SKILL_ABILITY$' every 2 within 20
wait-event antprox 'sent OBJECT_EFFECT$' within 15
wait-since antprox 'sent OBJECT_EFFECT$' 1
shot skill_rally
click 865,960 until antprox 'received SKILL_ABILITY$' every 2 within 20
wait-event antprox 'sent OBJECT_EFFECT$' within 15
wait-since antprox 'sent OBJECT_EFFECT$' 1
shot skill_repair
key 0x46
expect-event antprox 'received ACTION$' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent CLIENT_DAMAGE$' within 30
shot fighting
wait-event antprox 'sent POINT_EFFECT$' within 180
wait-event antprox 'sent CREATE$' within 15
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 30
shot mob_destroyed
# N until the hulk is the target: its verb list holds Loot (VERB_UPDATE 0x18 bytes, one verb; our own ship's has
# none, 0x10). Next Target walks the client's list by sphere distance (target_find.cpp), and the hulk and our ship
# are both at 0 (inside their radii): which comes first follows the object list's order, so the hulk's game id
# (run 011235: hulk first; runs 004450 / 005412: our ship first). The ITEM_BASEs come only for loot bases the
# client has not seen yet: no event to wait on.
key 0x4E until antprox '005c \[0018\] = sent VERB_UPDATE$' every 2 within 20
shot hulk_targeted
click 1229,685 until antprox 'sent LOOT_HULK_PERMISSION$' every 2 within 20
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 20
shot loot_window
click 1139,351 until antprox 'sent OPEN_INTERFACE$' every 1.5 within 40
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE$' within 5
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 30
shot looted
expect-no CRASH
